{"id": "16-1063-10-11", "zh": "kabbati（骄傲）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1063-12-13", "zh": "khabbati（骄傲）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1063-14-15", "zh": "gabbati（骄傲）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1064-2-5", "zh": "abi、dabi 表示发声。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1064-6-7", "zh": "ambati（发声）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1064-8-11", "zh": "ambā（母亲）、ambu（水）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1064-12-13", "zh": "dambati（发声）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1065-2-4", "zh": "labi 表示垂挂。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1065-5-7", "zh": "avasaṃsana 就是下垂、悬挂。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1065-8-13", "zh": "lambati（垂挂）、vilambati（悬垂）、byālambati（四面垂挂）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1065-14-19", "zh": "“太阳向低处沉落。”", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1065-20-22", "zh": "ālambati（攀缘、依附）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1065-23-31", "zh": "ālambana（所缘）、tadālambana、tadālambaṇa，或者 tadālamba（彼所缘）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1065-32-33", "zh": "lābu（葫芦）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1065-34-41", "zh": "也作 alābu，因为这里的 a 字表示词义本身不变。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "16-1066-2-4", "zh": "以上是以 b 结尾的词根的词形。", "confidence": 85}
